Spec: Actual server-authorized business fixture

Purpose:
  Exercise signed server authority and local grants at real Windows publishing and consuming Agents.

Owns:
  ./DataFixture.cs

References:
  /windows/LinkGate.Broker/SecurePeerServer.sdd
  /windows/LinkGate.Broker/SecureConnections.sdd

Must:
  Register and consume through actual held-process-verified SDK pipes, then explicitly approve only the fixture application's fixed loopback service.
  Use the same owner-issued nonexportable test identities as the actual Go control clients and require both server leases and local grants.
  Deliver deterministic sixty-four MiB responses with application challenge and request FIN, then hold real blocked streams for server revocation.
  Own and cancel all listeners, hosts and backend sockets; never export private identity keys or publish arbitrary targets.
